algorithms.pseudocode:
function TropicalRateDistortion(φ, d, D):
    best_y ← 0
    best_profile ← max_{x=1..n} (φ[x] - d[x][0])
    for y = 1 to m-1:
        profile ← max_{x=1..n} (φ[x] - d[x][y])
        if profile < best_profile:
            best_profile ← profile
            best_y ← y
    return (best_profile - D, best_y)

Time: O(nm), Space: O(1)
